@videoId=uuid

### Create drafted Video
POST {{host}}/api/v1/video
Authorization: Bearer {{variables.access-token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "title video",
  "description": "desc video"
}

### Get User Draft Videos
GET {{host}}/api/v1/video/me?status=DRAFT
Authorization: Bearer {{variables.access-token}}

### Get User Videos Being Processed
GET {{host}}/api/v1/video/me?status=PROCESSING
Authorization: Bearer {{variables.access-token}}

### Get User Videos Ready to Publish
GET {{host}}/api/v1/video/me?status=READY
Authorization: Bearer {{variables.access-token}}

### Get Public Video 
GET {{host}}/api/v1/video/{{videoId}}
